      "title": "Dividend of ₹5.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹5.00. Ex-date: 27th January 2026 Payment date: 17th February 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.3%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (15% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (21% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 17% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 70% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
